  // ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // WP18: the four silences.
  //
  // Every key below exists because somebody who had to act was told nothing.
  // Each silence was measured in the live system before a word was written:
  //
  //   1. THE NURSE AND CONSENT. consent.signed.nurse and consent.declined.nurse
  //      did not exist. flows.ts sends the signed and the declined news to the
  //      patient, to ops and to the doctor. The one person who cannot start the
  //      infusion without consent, and who is about to cross the city to reach
  //      the door, learned nothing either way.
  //
  //   2. THE POC AND FIVE WHOLE STAGES. notifyPoc hangs off notifyDoctor's
  //      finally block, so the POC receives what the DOCTOR receives and
  //      nothing else. offer (13 keys), consent (12), confirm (14), standby
  //      (13) and remind (3) carried ZERO poc mirror between them. The family
  //      rings the POC, and the POC was the last to know.
  //
  //   3. THE SUPPLIER HAS NO INBOUND VOICE. scripts/reply_coverage.mjs measures
  //      the supplier role SILENT at all 11 case statuses. "We cannot deliver
  //      today" arrives and produces nothing at all.
  //
  //   4. THE DEAD ZONE. relay.ts LIVE_STATUSES stops at awaiting_payment and
  //      every case ends in paid, cancelled or archived, so every family, POC,
  //      doctor and supplier drops permanently out of routing the moment their
  //      case closes. Their next message reaches nobody and is answered by
  //      nothing.
  //
  // NONE OF THESE KEYS HAS A LIVE CALL SITE YET. The `sites` entry on each one
  // is the ANCHOR LINE where the retrofit lands, not a send that exists today.
  // The handler, admin-actions and dashboard packages are wiring them in this
  // same wave. That is recorded here rather than in a commit message because
  // this file is the thing the next person opens.
  // ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  // ── consent: the nurse finally hears the answer ──────────────────────────
